    "created_at": "2016-03-02T08:06:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-02T08:06:02Z",
    "body": "HTML currently uses \"whitespace\" a lot and \"white space\" only in a few examples. Encoding uses \"whitespace\" and DOM imports that.\n\nSo I'd prefer to stick with whitespace, of course mostly because it happens to match what I'm used to.\n",
