    "body": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Wide_Web is very confused on when to capitalize it and when not. Seems easier to me to just lowercase it, but some people really care about the distinction between \"web\" and \"Web\", and \"internet\" and \"Internet\".\n",
